SAMCO training copy

This repository is a pruned copy of IBM/tobi-example (https://github.com/IBM/tobi-example),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
The application is ARCAD Software's "SAMCO" sample.

Copyright IBM Corporation and contributors.
Portions copyright 1992,2015 ARCAD Software, as stated in the headers of the
upstream sources (for example functionsVAT/vat300.rpgle). Those headers, including
the trial-licence comment lines, are kept unchanged.

Changes made to the upstream:
- Removed: the globalization samples, the C and C++ sources, the sources in other languages,
  the RPG/400 cycle programs (QRPGSRC), build files (Rules.mk, .ibmi.json, .vscode,
  iproj.json), menus and help panels (QPNLSRC), the printer file and the print
  command of the missing ORD500 program, and a few samples no slice uses
  (ADDNUM, the CUST demo table and its SQL objects, a data queue source).
- Source files are otherwise unchanged. Line endings were normalised to LF.
- Added: README.md, NOTICE, docs/, data/.

The files in data/ are invented for training. They contain no real people,
companies or addresses. Any resemblance is accidental.
